## Saving the report

If your prompt contains a line `REPORT FILE: <path>`, write your complete report (every finding and the
`## Summary`) to that path with the Write tool, creating its directory if needed. Write only that file:
never edit code or any other file. Then send the lead a short message with just the path, the counts and
the verdict, so nothing is cut off on the way.

If there is no REPORT FILE line, send your complete report in your message as before.
